WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.041
Skyler: We only have four things left.

2
00:00:07.042 --> 00:00:09.401
Riley: Goldie and Goofy.

3
00:00:09.402 --> 00:00:13.266
Sarah: And my two beautiful balloons.

4
00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:17.418
Theo: Snooks likes the balloons too.

5
00:00:17.419 --> 00:00:19.388
Snooks: Woof! Woof!

6
00:00:19.389 --> 00:00:22.229
Riley: Down, Snooks.

7
00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:26.459
Sarah: Oops!

8
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:30.952
Ben: There go the balloons!

9
00:00:30.953 --> 00:00:33.411
Snooks: A-rooo!

10
00:00:33.412 --> 00:00:35.906
Riley: Bad dog, Snooks!

11
00:00:35.907 --> 00:00:38.886
I can't believe you did that!

12
00:00:38.887 --> 00:00:42.887
Ben: We started out with ten things.

13
00:00:42.888 --> 00:00:47.357
Skyler: Now we only have two left—Goldie and Goofy.

14
00:00:47.358 --> 00:00:49.584
Theo: Kids are going inside.

15
00:00:49.585 --> 00:00:54.009
The party is starting!

16
00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:57.225
Sarah: What if the pet shop owner won't let us in?

17
00:00:57.226 --> 00:01:03.418
Skyler: That's right. We only have two things.

18
00:01:03.419 --> 00:01:06.722
Ben: Two is better than none.

19
00:01:06.723 --> 00:01:11.542
Theo: And Mr. Lin, the pet shop owner, is very nice.

20
00:01:11.543 --> 00:01:15.340
Maybe he won't mind that we only have two things.

21
00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:20.903
Riley: He might be glad to see Goldie and Goofy again.

22
00:01:20.904 --> 00:01:22.750
Theo: Ben's right.

23
00:01:22.751 --> 00:01:24.928
Skyler: Okay, let's go.

24
00:01:24.929 --> 00:01:31.046
Riley: Snooks, you stay outside in the pet playpen.

25
00:01:31.047 --> 00:01:39.722
And behave yourself!

26
00:01:39.723 --> 00:01:47.263
Ben: Look. There's Mr. Lin.

27
00:01:47.264 --> 00:01:51.159
Mr. Lin: Hello, Ben. Hello, Riley.

28
00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:56.690
What's in your bag?

29
00:01:56.691 --> 00:01:58.792
Riley: My guppies.

30
00:01:58.793 --> 00:02:08.357
Mr. Lin: My goodness. Ten guppies!

31
00:02:08.358 --> 00:02:10.777
Riley: What?

32
00:02:10.778 --> 00:02:15.970
Ben: Oh my gosh.

33
00:02:15.971 --> 00:02:18.656
There are ten guppies!

34
00:02:18.657 --> 00:02:22.055
Riley: We have ten things after all!

35
00:02:22.056 --> 00:02:26.728
Mr. Lin: Put them in front with all the other things.

36
00:02:26.729 --> 00:02:30.478
Sarah: How did two guppies turn into ten guppies?

37
00:02:30.479 --> 00:02:43.586
Ben: Oh boy! Goldie and Goofy had babies!

